      "sourceTextSha256": "d04e781af0e3473f73eb5299635d16ff326e74b24e3d71ce99d68a748eaf84f0",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast at the hotel. Wine excursion with tastings. In the morning, meet your wine-specialist guide and set off for the wine oasis, home to historic wineries and producers of top-quality wines, with the Andes as a backdrop. Visit two to three wineries, where your guide introduces you to winemaking, from vineyard care and harvesting to ageing and bottling, and explains the technique of wine tasting, the importance of corks and the choice of glasses.",
